        "@value": "Lethbridge Folk Club Presents The John Hewitt Trio"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;John Hewitt is often considered one of the hardest working musicians in Alberta. Performing at over 150 tour dates per year and releasing 2-3 full length albums in the process, he is one of the most prolific songwriters on the scene. Join us at the Army Navy Air Force Club.&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
