    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;“The first time I heard her I was captured...unable to walk away. There was such a haunting quality to her voice, it was like some mystic rare bird singing in the wilderness.”&lt;/p&gt;\\n&lt;p&gt;Bruce D. Miller -&lt;/p&gt;\\n&lt;p&gt;Leanne Lightfoot, grew up in a house filled with music, on a little farm outside of Salmon Arm, British Columbia. &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
    ],
