        "@value": "Horizon Ridge"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Meet Horizon Ridge: Helen Goodchild, Dianne Quinton, Peter May, and Steve Goodchild&lt;br /&gt;\\nMulti-instrumentalists and singers. Dianne, Helen, Steve and Peter take their inspiration from a whole world of music styles. A group of fine singers, songwriters, and players with a passion for music. Where nothing is off-limits as long as the music is good. For more information about Horizon Ridge go to their website at: https://horizonridge.ca/&lt;br /&gt;\\nThe opener for Horizon Ridge will be Cathy Hawley&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
    ],
